init.description:
Choose how volumes are shown: follow Home Assistant's unit system, follow the unit set in the WaterH app, or pick mL or fl. oz. Leave the client ID and secret empty to use the built-in values; only fill them in if WaterH changes the values in their app (see the README).

**WaterH Sync Android app (optional):** to get bottle battery and charging sensors, paste this URL into the app under Settings → Home Assistant. Keep it private; anyone with it can report bottle status.

{webhook_url}
